{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42578","headline":"留宿廖融山斋 · 杨徽之","name":"留宿廖融山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清和春尚在，欢醉日何长。\n谷鸟随柯转，庭花夺酒香。\n初晴岩翠滴，向晚树阴凉。\n别有堪吟处，相留宿草堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨徽之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}